     typst template ({font}, Times New Roman, LR Civ P 7.1(a)(4)) at 12 pt (size 24 half points; footnotes too); Body
     Text in exact 24 pt line boxes (typst pitch-body, LR Civ P 7.1(a)(3) double spacing) with a half-inch first-line
     indent; Block Text (quotations) and Footnote Text in 13.8 pt boxes (typst pitch-single; LR Civ P 7.1(a)(3) allows
