     apart (typst note-gap); letter page with 1-inch margins (LR Civ P 7.1(a)(3)). docx/motion-brief.lua writes the
     cover, the headings and the signature with their own spacing, the cover's empty footer and the body's page number
     (a 13.8 pt line 36.6 pt above the page foot: 732 twips, where typst sets it, footer-descent 30 %). Twips: 20 x pt. -->
